Subject: Declare GLU's direct dependency on libm
Origin: Filnix
Upstream-Status: Not submitted

GLU calls sin, cos, sqrt and sqrtf. Native libstdc++ can mask the missing
dependency; Fil-C's libc++ does not. Link the library itself to libm.
The installed consumer check in tests/media.nix exercises gluProject and
gluUnProject without a GL context.

--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -104,7 +104,7 @@
     inc_include,
   ],
   gnu_symbol_visibility : 'hidden',
-  dependencies : [dep_gl],
+  dependencies : [dep_gl, meson.get_compiler('c').find_library('m')],
   version : '1.3.1',
   darwin_versions  : [ '5.0.0', '5.1.0' ],
   install : true,
